  "_comment": "Window class (and title) -> block material for the block-break close and block-place open sounds (block.hit|break|place.<material>). First matching rule wins; `class` and `title` are case-insensitive regular expressions, a rule needs every field it names. Edit freely: the shell re-reads this file on start.",
